Zen Read is an Android-native rewrite (Kotlin, Jetpack Compose) of Modu Reader:
https://github.com/sobranie2406/modureader (ported from commit 83e39a79).
Modu Reader derives from Anx Reader (https://github.com/anxcye/anx-reader) and
ReadAny (https://github.com/codedogQBY/ReadAny).

